  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">US India Clean Energy Cooperation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support U.S. objectives to strengthen the strategic relationship with India and make it one of the defining partnerships of the 21st century, as called for by President Obama. Indias energy development is directly tied to its economic development, and therefore, its ability to develop into a stable long-term strategic partner. Additionally, energy plays a central role in a wide range of priority issues with India from climate change to energy security to trade and investment.</narrative>
  </description>
